              "text": "`tight_layout()` automatically adjusts subplot parameters so the subplot(s) fit into the figure area; it checks the extents of tick labels, axis labels, and titles. Without it, labels can be clipped or overlap. Call it as `plt.tight_layout()` or `fig.tight_layout()` \u2014 both work.",
